{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s19-p01",
      "text": "Has a person ever warmly held a door open for you?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p02",
      "text": "How do you feel after playing with friends?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p03",
      "text": "And what is your favourite family memory?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p04",
      "text": "These questions have one thing in common.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p04.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p05",
      "text": "They're all about connecting with people.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p06",
      "text": "'Let's Connect' is a theme of Children's Mental Health Week.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p07",
      "text": "It improves mental health by building healthy social connections.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p08",
      "text": "Humans naturally connect with others.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p09",
      "text": "But it doesn't mean people should always feel that they are glued together.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p09.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p10",
      "text": "Healthy connections give people energy and support.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p11",
      "text": "We all need people to share our worries with.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p12",
      "text": "Social connections aren't just about mental health; they improve physical health too.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p13",
      "text": "Research suggests being lonely can slowly harm your health.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p13.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p14",
      "text": "What's important is not how many relationships you have, but how good they are.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p14.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p15",
      "text": "Then how to connect with others?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p16",
      "text": "You can reach out and connect with people in many different ways.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p16.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p17",
      "text": "You can connect with your friends or parents by sharing a pizza or visiting the zoo together to see penguins, elephants and other animals.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p17.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p18",
      "text": "Organising a picnic with hamburgers or setting up a tent at a camping site can also be good ways to find shared adventures.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p18.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p19",
      "text": "It's not just people, either.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p19.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p20",
      "text": "Some people feel connected with their pets when spending time at the park.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p20.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p20.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p21",
      "text": "It is recommended to build more connections through actions as well as words.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p21.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p21.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p22",
      "text": "Listening to others and trying new experiences are good tools.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p22.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p22.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p23",
      "text": "Everybody may feel lonely sometimes and refuse to talk to others.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p23.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p23.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p24",
      "text": "But remember that there are always people that care for you.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p24.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p24.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19-p25",
      "text": "It's important to tell someone you trust about your feelings.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p25.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s19-p25.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
